,"document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"준비는 언제나 되어있지","source_cn":"我一向准备充分","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4B31BD1A76C0A190","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"준비는 언제나 되어있지","female":"준비는 언제나 되어있지","variant_male_record_index":"69976","variant_female_record_index":"69977","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"그래. 바로 가자!","source_cn":"没问题，立刻出发！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC648596111238CEF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래. 바로 가자!","female":"그래. 바로 가자!","variant_male_record_index":"69978","variant_female_record_index":"69979","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221380.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221380","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322138001:1":{"text":"여신님께 찬미를. 오셨군요! 맥심 형제님과 저는 준비가 끝났습니다.","source_cn":"赞美女神，你们来了！希望这次我和马克西姆兄弟准备得足够充分。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82384CD45EB463B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322138002:1":{"text":"솔직히 말하면, 조금 무섭네요. 심장이 너무 빨리 뛰어요... 하지만 불평하지 않겠습니다. 이것은 제가 해야 할 일이자 여신님께서 인도하신 바른 길이니까요.","source_cn":"说实话，我有些害怕，心跳得很快……但我没什么可抱怨的，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED127AEBCB327BE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322138003:1":{"text":"여신님께서 우리를 보호하실 겁니다.","source_cn":"女神会保佑我们的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EE38C391F6B2D00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322138004:1":{"text":"저도 그렇게 믿습니다. 캐롤라이나 양, 길을 안내해 주시지요.","source_cn":"我对此坚信不疑。卡列琳娜女士，请您带路吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC608EC6B6C8C8285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士奥格列":{"text":"수도사 오그리","source":"修士奥格列","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士马克西姆":{"text":"수도사 맥심","source":"修士马克西姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221400.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221400","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322140001:1":{"text":"이게 마지막 전투야! 평화와 안식을 위한 영혼의 전투!","source_cn":"这是最后一场战斗！一场通往和平与宁静的灵魂之战！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51220CB3C4CA407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322140002:0":{"text":"전사들이여, 집결하라!","source_cn":"我的战士们，集合吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEB9FD9E06A49BC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322140003:1":{"text":"발리카... 장군님!","source_cn":"瓦丽卡……将军！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x427A7D176E465A7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322140004:1":{"text":"전사들이여, 얼음의 악마는 이미 봉인되었다. 그 전쟁에서... 우리가 이겼다!","source_cn":"战士们，冰之恶魔已经被封印，那场战争，我们——赢了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A8BF12A1C6BAC6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322140005:1":{"text":"이겼다고?\n...이겼다!!!","source_cn":"赢了？\\n……胜利了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38C9039E4CE0D90B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322140006:1":{"text":"오늘, 우리는 마지막으로 어깨를 나란히 하고 싸울 것이야. 이번 적은 우리 내면에 자리한 악의와 광기다.","source_cn":"今天，我们将最后一次并肩作战。这次我们的敌人是大家难以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15B597F062C8205E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322140007:1":{"text":"이게 마지막 전투야! 평화와 안식을 위한 영혼의 전투!","source_cn":"这是最后一场战斗！一场通往和平与宁静的灵魂之战！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51220CB3C4CA407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322140008:1":{"text":"여기서 이기면 우리는 빛과 따스함으로 가득한 미래에서 다시 만날 것이다!","source_cn":"赢下它！我们将会在充满光明和温暖的未来重逢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32C3B43953AB5473","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322140009:1":{"text":"장군님 밑에서 싸울 수 있어서... 영광입니다...","source_cn":"很荣幸……能在您麾下作战……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27185FA185F24443","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322140010:1":{"text":"발리카 장군님...","source_cn":"瓦丽卡将军……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58BFB3BC3DBF8307","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322140011:1":{"text":"여신이시여, 이 엄숙한 순간에 기도를 바칩니다... 슬픔이 밤을 지배할지라도, 평화는 새벽과 함께 찾아올 것이니...","source_cn":"女神啊，在这庄严的时刻，我们向您祷告……尽管悲伤在夜晚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3393311A73E28D49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322140012:1":{"text":"여신이시여, 은혜를 내려주소서. 죽음은 끝이 아니니, 그들을 당신의 나라로 인도하소서. 그곳에서는 모든 눈물을 닦고 영원한 안식에 들 수 있을 것입니다...","source_cn":"女神啊，赐予我们恩典，死亡不再是终结……让他们去往您的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACD968700DA04993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322140013:1":{"text":"영혼의 부름과 동시에 캐롤라이나의 따뜻한 목소리로 살아있는 시체들은 서서히 자아를 되찾고 광기를 억누르기 시작했다.","source_cn":"伴随着灵魂的召唤和卡列琳娜温柔的声音，活死人们渐渐找回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB315551176C35A41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1322140014:1":{"text":"오그리 수도사, 맥심 수도사! 정화를 시작하라!","source_cn":"奥格列修士、马克西姆修士，开始净化吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35F05C685DB42DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1322140015:1":{"text":"네, 발리카 님!","source_cn":"好的，瓦丽卡女士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x077299C35CC3DEDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1322140016:1":{"text":"두 수도사가 정화를 시작했다. 성스러운 빛 아래에서 일부 살아있는 시체들은 미소를 지으며 천천히 사라졌지만, 그 수가 많아 수도사들은 점차 지쳐갔다.","source_cn":"两位修士开始了净化。一些活死人在圣光的照耀之下，微笑着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB2D100AD5572A2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1322140017:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 수도사들을 도와줘!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB1D7EB35924B1A69","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 수도사들을 도와줘!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 수도사들을 도와줘!","variant_male_record_index":"150972","variant_female_record_index":"150973","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"발리카","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:活死人战士":{"text":"살아있는 시체 전사","source":"活死人战士","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士奥格列":{"text":"수도사 오그리","source":"修士奥格列","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":5}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221410.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221410","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322141001:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여. 저는... 모든 힘을 다 써버렸습니다...","source_cn":"艾雅在上，我……我已经耗尽所有力气了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4140D48C71267ACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322141002:1":{"text":"버텨야 해요... 이게 마지막입니다!","source_cn":"要坚持住……这是最后一个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE74B59C5F4D892BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1322141003:1":{"text":"성스러운 빛이 내리쬐면서 마지막 살아있는 시체가 발리카를 향해 경례를 하고 빛 속으로 서서히 사라졌다.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97C72DCFC7EBFBD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322141004:1":{"text":"헉, 헉... 성공한 건가요? 살아있는 시체들이... 전사들이... 정말 정화된 건가요?","source_cn":"呼……呼……成功了吗？那些活死人……那些战士们，真的被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED16852B5A530201","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322141005:1":{"text":"이제... 더 이상 이성을 잃고 살아있는 시체로 되살아나지 않을 겁니다, 그렇죠?","source_cn":"他们……他们不会再一次又一次复生为没有理智的活死人了，是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2EE7182DE7143FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322141006:1":{"text":"그래. 그들은 영원한 안식에 들었다.","source_cn":"是的。他们永远地离开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58D2775F32D37C65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322141007:1":{"text":"발리카 언니, 슬퍼하지 마. 그들은 여신님의 품으로 간 거야. 그곳에는 고통도 이별도 없이, 영원한 빛만 있을 거야.","source_cn":"瓦丽卡姐姐，别难过。他们去了女神的神国，那里没有痛苦和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF9FA619920C5918","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322141008:1":{"text":"그래... 드디어 안식을 찾았어. 기쁘네, 정말로.","source_cn":"是啊……他们终于可以获得安宁了。我很高兴，真的很高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2964D0915BAF51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322141009:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여, 이건 기적입니다! 위대한 기적이에요! 수도원의 모두를 대표해 감사와 축복을 전합니다!","source_cn":"艾雅在上，这是个奇迹！伟大的奇迹！我……我代表修道院所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6493E57DB91870A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322141010:1":{"text":"아니요. 제가 두 분께 감사를 드려야지요. 여신님의 축복이 함께하시기를.","source_cn":"不，应该是我谢谢你们两位。愿女神赐福于你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81168B138CE589ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322141011:1":{"text":"맥심 형제님. 어서 돌아갑시다... 이 기쁜 소식을 성당에 알려야 해요! 여러분, 먼저 실례하겠습니다.","source_cn":"马克西姆兄弟，我们快回去……我们得立刻把这个好消息报告...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6FC30DE7BD01126","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322141012:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주셔서 정말 감사해요. 당신이 없었다면 오늘이 오기까지 훨씬 더 오랜 시간이 걸렸을 거예요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4A367B6F59BF7249","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주셔서 정말 감사해요. 당신이 없었다면 오늘이 오기까지 훨씬 더 오랜 시간이 걸렸을 거예요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주셔서 정말 감사해요. 당신이 없었다면 오늘이 오기까지 훨씬 더 오랜 시간이 걸렸을 거예요.","variant_male_record_index":"150985","variant_female_record_index":"150986","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322141013:1":{"text":"몇 번을 감사해도 부족할 것 같아. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 화이트마운틴의 그레이브본은 앞으로 너의 가장 굳건한 동맹이 될 거라고 맹세하지!","source_cn":"一百次感谢的言辞都不足以表达我们内心的感受。<styl...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x835A54D81CBA7FC2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"몇 번을 감사해도 부족할 것 같아. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 화이트마운틴의 그레이브본은 앞으로 너의 가장 굳건한 동맹이 될 거라고 맹세하지!","female":"몇 번을 감사해도 부족할 것 같아. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 화이트마운틴의 그레이브본은 앞으로 너의 가장 굳건한 동맹이 될 거라고 맹세하지!","variant_male_record_index":"150987","variant_female_record_index":"150988","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1322141014:1":{"text":"발리카와 캐롤라이나는 다시 한 번 감사의 인사를 전했다. 모두 작별 인사를 나누며 슬픔과 절망으로 물들었던 이 땅을 떠났다.","source_cn":"瓦丽卡和卡列琳娜再次向你致谢。大家互相道别，离开了这片...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B334A42F3DD50A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士奥格列":{"text":"수도사 오그리","source":"修士奥格列","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士马克西姆":{"text":"수도사 맥심","source":"修士马克西姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"발리카","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":6}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221420.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221420","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221420","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322142001:0":{"text":"마스터, 이제 어디로 가볼까요?","source_cn":"主人，我们接下来去哪里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3B69F8AB8C3C9039","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 이제 어디로 가볼까요?","female":"마스터, 이제 어디로 가볼까요?","variant_male_record_index":"150990","variant_female_record_index":"150991","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322142002:0":{"text":"그동안 바빴으니 온천에 가서 좀 쉬자.","source_cn":"忙了这么久，就去泡个温泉，放松一下吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC73AE2EC76118116","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그동안 바빴으니 온천에 가서 좀 쉬자.","female":"그동안 바빴으니 온천에 가서 좀 쉬자.","variant_male_record_index":"150992","variant_female_record_index":"150993","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221450.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221450","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221450","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322145001:0":{"text":"성기사,여자...?","source_cn":"圣骑士，女性……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF3F0D9637343DFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322145002:0":{"text":"누구일까요?","source_cn":"会是谁呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x148BEF57E980482A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221460.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221460","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322146001:1":{"text":"저기, 혹시 최근에 성기사가 시더 마을에 온 적이 있나요?","source_cn":"这位先生，请问最近是有圣骑士前来雪松镇吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410F5EF61BEBA1EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322146002:1":{"text":"아, 맞아요! 어제 오셨는데, 이름이... 아, 테미히아라고 했어요. 커다란 말을 타신 모습이 정말 멋지더라고요!","source_cn":"啊，是的是的！昨天来的，是位叫……呃，对了，名叫特弥希...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87DC0850BBB49EDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322146003:1":{"text":"테미히아라니! 분명 화이트마운틴 수도원의 성직자들을 도와 이번일을 처리하러 온 걸 거예요.","source_cn":"竟然是特弥希娅！她一定是来协助白山修道院的圣职者们处理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E3647A561BE84CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322146004:1":{"text":"근데 성기사님께서 그러시더라고요. 화이트마운틴의 살아있는 시체들은 악마의 부하가 아니라 과거에 악마와 싸운 전사들이래요!","source_cn":"也不知道怎么回事，圣骑士大人说咱们白山的那些活死人不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F7BC5BC087177F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322146005:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여! 정말일까요? 너무 혼란스러워요...","source_cn":"艾雅在上，这到底是真的还是假的？！真是把我给弄糊涂了……","status":"match